{"seq":26,"slug":"ecommerce-inventory-forecasting","title":"库存预测与补货","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting","rating":{"composite":4.32,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"库存预测与补货\">库存预测与补货</h1><p>库存管理是电商运营的核心命题：库存过多占用资金、积压变滞销；库存过少则导致缺货、损失销售机会。本 hub 系统讲解如何用定量模型和数据驱动方法，在不确定需求下做出最优库存决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-解决的核心问题\">本 hub 解决的核心问题</h2><p>电商库存管理面临三重不确定性：<strong>需求不确定</strong>（消费者购买行为难以精确预测）、<strong>供应不确定</strong>（供应商交货时间和数量存在波动）、<strong>环境不确定</strong>（促销、季节、竞争等外部冲击）。传统经验式补货依赖采购员直觉，难以处理 SKU 数量爆炸和供应链复杂度。本 hub 提供从理论到工程的完整知识体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>建模基础</strong>：EOQ/新闻贩子/基础库存策略，奠定优化目标</li>\n<li><strong>预测方法</strong>：时间序列经典方法到深度学习，覆盖不同数据条件</li>\n<li><strong>补货决策</strong>：再订货点、动态优化、多级库存协调</li>\n<li><strong>运营落地</strong>：ABC 分类差异化管理、大促备货、健康指标监控</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位边界\">本 hub 的定位边界</h2><p>本 hub 专注于<strong>库存预测与补货决策</strong>的方法论与工程实现，与相邻 hub 的分工如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>供应链管理（19_supply-chain-management）</td>\n<td>供应商管理、采购合同、物流网络设计</td>\n<td>本 hub 是供应链中&quot;库存控制&quot;这一环节的深化，供应链管理提供更宏观的端到端视角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商运营（04_ecommerce-operations）</td>\n<td>仓储作业、履单流程、客服与售后</td>\n<td>运营关注执行层面，本 hub 关注预测与决策层面；二者在大促期间高度协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态定价策略（23_dynamic-pricing-strategies）</td>\n<td>价格弹性、竞价算法、价格优化</td>\n<td>定价影响需求，本 hub 将价格作为需求预测的输入特征，而非直接研究定价决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"适合谁阅读\">适合谁阅读</h2><p>本 hub 面向<strong>中级电商数据工程师、供应链算法工程师、库存规划分析师</strong>，假设读者具备基础统计学知识和 Python 编程能力。内容覆盖从数学公式推导到工程实现，从单品 SKU 到多级网络，从日常补货到大促备货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节导览\">章节导览</h2><p><strong>第 1 章：库存基础与建模</strong> — 建立决策框架，理解 EOQ、新闻贩子模型、基础库存策略的原理与适用场景，掌握安全库存计算和服务水平定义。</p>\n<p><strong>第 2 章：预测方法</strong> — 从 STL 分解、ETS、ARIMA 到 Prophet、DeepAR，系统掌握时间序列预测；学习 XGBoost 等机器学习方法处理促销/日历特征；解决冷启动场景下新品预测问题。</p>\n<p><strong>第 3 章：补货策略</strong> — 深入 (s,S)/(s,Q) 策略的选择与参数优化；学习动态规划和滚动时域优化；解决多级仓储网络（中心仓-前置仓）的牛鞭效应与 MEIO 协调。</p>\n<p><strong>第 4 章：库存运营管理</strong> — 掌握 ABC/XYZ 分类与差异化策略；制定大促备货方案、提前期压缩和应急补货；建立周转天数、缺货率、GMROI 等完整健康指标体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>供应链管理（hubs/24_ecommerce/19_supply-chain-management）：理解库存在端到端供应链中的位置</li>\n<li>动态定价策略（hubs/24_ecommerce/23_dynamic-pricing-strategies）：需求侧价格调控与库存联动</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"库存基础与建模","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-models","title":"库存模型：EOQ、新闻贩子与基础库存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals/inventory-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-forecasting-overview","title":"需求预测方法概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals/demand-forecasting-overview"},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-stock-service-level","title":"安全库存与服务水平","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/fundamentals/safety-stock-service-level"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"forecasting","title":"预测方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/forecasting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-series-methods","title":"时间序列预测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/forecasting/time-series-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ml-demand-forecasting","title":"机器学习需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/forecasting/ml-demand-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cold-start-forecasting","title":"新品冷启动预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/forecasting/cold-start-forecasting"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"replenishment","title":"补货策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/replenishment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reorder-point-strategy","title":"再订货点策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/replenishment/reorder-point-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-replenishment","title":"动态补货优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/replenishment/dynamic-replenishment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-echelon-inventory","title":"多级库存规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/replenishment/multi-echelon-inventory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"库存运营管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abc-classification","title":"ABC 分类管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations/abc-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"promotion-inventory-planning","title":"大促备货规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations/promotion-inventory-planning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inventory-health-metrics","title":"库存健康指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations/inventory-health-metrics"}]}]}